					"content": "希望…我的問題能夠得到解答…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210000603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 210000603,
					"content": "應該會的。",
